write(u,'帮忙先问清楚',['Ask for a bounded favour with consent','Use 为 for a beneficiary without confusing 给','Interpret 有 in an evaluation'],[
('为','for; on behalf of','vì; cho','preposition','我为朋友打印两页材料。','I print two pages of materials for my friend.'),('加油','to cheer on; refuel','cố lên; đổ nhiên liệu','verb','比赛前我们说加油。','Before the match we say Keep it up.'),('求','to request; seek','xin; tìm kiếm','verb','这个问题可以求别人帮忙，别一个人着急。','You can seek help with this problem; do not worry alone.'),('取','to collect; take','lấy','verb','下午去取打印好的材料。','Collect the printed materials in the afternoon.'),('取得','to obtain; achieve','đạt được','verb','先取得她的同意，再帮她报名。','Obtain her consent before signing her up.'),('拿到','to get; receive','nhận được','verb','拿到材料以后，检查页数。','Once you get the materials, check the number of pages.'),('借','to borrow; lend','mượn; cho mượn','verb','我想向老师借一本书。','I would like to borrow a book from the teacher.'),('打印','to print','in','verb','只打印两页，不是整本书。','Print only two pages, not the whole book.'),('计算机','computer','máy tính','noun','计算机在办公室里。','The computer is in the office.'),('办公室','office','văn phòng','noun','先问办公室什么时候开门。','First ask when the office opens.'),('教师','teacher','giáo viên','noun','教师不是每天都在办公室。','The teacher is not in the office every day.'),('教室','classroom','phòng học','noun','教室里还有人在上课。','People are still having class in the classroom.'),('教学','teaching; instruction','việc giảng dạy','noun','这是教学用的材料。','These are teaching materials.'),('教育','education; to educate','giáo dục','noun','教育活动也要说明目的。','An educational activity should also explain its purpose.'),('讲','to speak; tell; explain','nói; giảng','verb','请把要打印哪两页讲清楚。','Please explain clearly which two pages to print.'),('讲话','to speak; give a talk','nói chuyện; phát biểu','verb','老师讲话时，我先听完再问。','When the teacher speaks, I listen to the end before asking.'),('家长','parent or guardian','phụ huynh','noun','这个活动需要家长同意。','This activity requires parental or guardian consent.'),('高中','senior high school','trung học phổ thông','noun','她在高中工作，不是这个大学。','She works at a senior high school, not this university.'),('中小学','primary and secondary schools','trường phổ thông','noun','这是中小学教师的活动。','This is an activity for primary and secondary teachers.'),('校园','school campus','khuôn viên trường','noun','校园里的路要先看地图。','Check a map first for the roads on campus.'),('校长','school principal','hiệu trưởng','noun','校长还没有答应这个计划。','The principal has not yet agreed to this plan.'),('级','level; grade; class','cấp; bậc','noun','这份材料的级别不同，先问清楚。','These materials are for a different level; first clarify.')],
[grammar(u,'二28','为 + 受益者 + 动作','Identify whom an action benefits',
'为朋友打印 identifies the beneficiary. 给朋友两页材料 identifies the recipient in a transfer; the patterns can describe different aspects of the same event. 为 wèi here is not wéi in 成为. A beneficiary phrase does not prove that permission has been obtained. Ask first when the action affects another person’s records.',[
('我为朋友打印材料。','I print materials for my friend.'),('先为她问清楚，再给她答复。','First clarify for her, then give her a reply.'),('我不能替她同意。','I cannot agree on her behalf.')],('我为她同意参加，所以她一定愿意。','先取得她的同意，再帮她报名。','An action for someone is not evidence of their consent.')),
grammar(u,'二55','有 + 意思 / 用 / 时间等：评价或条件','Read 有 in a stated evaluation',
'这份材料有用 evaluates usefulness, rather than saying the material owns a physical object called 用. 很有意思 evaluates interest. 我有时间 remains an availability statement. Identify the whole phrase; possession and evaluation are separate uses, and usefulness depends on the stated task.',[
('这两页材料很有用。','These two pages are useful.'),('这个例子很有意思。','This example is interesting.'),('我下午有时间帮你。','I have time to help you this afternoon.')],('这材料是有用的东西有。','这份材料很有用。','Use 有用 as the evaluation predicate.'))],
text(u,'d','Two pages, after permission','Find the exact favour and what must happen first.',[
('你下午有时间吗？能为我打印材料吗？','Do you have time this afternoon? Can you print materials for me?'),('可以，哪几页？','Yes; which pages?'),('第二页和第三页，两页就够。','Pages two and three; two pages are enough.'),('好。办公室几点开？','Okay. When does the office open?'),('下午两点，计算机和打印机都可以用。','At two in the afternoon; the computer and printer are available.'),('那我两点去取，拿到以后给你。','Then I will collect them at two and give them to you once I have them.'),('活动也帮我报名吧。','Please sign me up for the activity too.'),('先取得你的同意：是星期六的活动吗？','First let me get your consent: do you mean Saturday’s activity?')],
[('mainidea','What favour is clearly specified?',['Print pages two and three','Print the whole book','Agree for the principal'],0),('detail','When does the office open?',['Two in the afternoon','Three in the morning','Saturday at six'],0),('inference','Is activity registration already completed?',['No, consent and the activity are still being clarified','Yes, the last line confirms completion','Yes, printing counts as registration'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','A careful volunteer note','Read the scope of the favour before acting.',[
('今天我为朋友打印两页教学材料。','Today I print two pages of teaching materials for a friend.'),('第二页和第三页很有用，不用打印整本书。','Pages two and three are useful; there is no need to print the whole book.'),('办公室下午两点开，里面有计算机。','The office opens at two in the afternoon and contains a computer.'),('教室还在上课，不去那里取。','Class is still in progress in the classroom; do not collect the materials there.'),('拿到材料以后，检查页数，再给朋友。','After receiving the materials, check the page count and give them to the friend.'),('打印是自愿帮助，不是代替朋友同意参加。','Printing is voluntary help, not consent to participate on the friend’s behalf.'),('活动的时间和责任都要讲清楚。','The activity’s time and responsibilities must be explained clearly.'),('取得同意以后才能报名，校长也还没有答应计划。','Register only after obtaining consent; the principal has not agreed to the plan either.')],
[('mainidea','What principle organizes the note?',['Clarify the task and obtain consent','Assume every request is complete permission','Print every page'],0),('detail','Where are materials collected?',['The office','The occupied classroom','The campus entrance'],0),('inference','Can printing confirm attendance?',['No','Yes','Only for teachers'],0)],[(0,'打印'),(5,'帮助')]),
text(u,'media','A helpful printer','Read an original scene about the limits of helping.',[
('加油，我为你打印！','Keep it up; I will print for you!'),('谢谢，两页，不是二十页。','Thanks; two pages, not twenty.'),('好，两页。还有报名呢？','Okay, two pages. What about registration?'),('先讲清楚时间，我还没同意。','Explain the time first; I have not agreed yet.'),('行，帮助不是替你选择。','Okay; helping is not choosing for you.'),('这句话很有用。先取材料吧。','That sentence is useful. Let us collect the materials first.')],
[('inference','What correction matters?',['Consent is separate from the printing favour','Twenty pages were requested','The activity has already occurred'],0)],drama=True),
dict(tf=[('打印','只打印第二页和第三页。','Print only pages two and three.','The whole book is requested.',False,'只 limits the scope.'),('取得','先取得同意，再报名。','Obtain consent first, then register.','Consent precedes registration.',True,'先…再 states the order.')],reply=[('讲','哪两页？请讲清楚。','Which two pages? Please clarify.',['第二页和第三页。','整本吧，我没说。','我不是校长。'],0,'Name the exact pages.'),('借','我想借一本书。','I would like to borrow a book.',['可以，下周请还给我。','我已经吃了两页。','不问就替你同意。'],0,'Grant a loan with a return expectation.')],fill=[('办公室','办公室下午两点开。','The office opens at two in the afternoon.'),('拿到','拿到材料以后再给她。','Give her the materials after you get them.')],match=[('教师',[('中小学教师。','Primary and secondary teachers.'),('校园里的路。','Roads on campus.'),('教学材料。','Teaching materials.')]),('为',[('为朋友打印。','Print for a friend.'),('给朋友材料。','Give materials to a friend.'),('自己先同意。','Agree personally first.')])]),
[('Bounded help','可以，哪两页？','Yes; which two pages?','Clarify scope before acting.'),('Consent first','你同意以后，我再帮你报名。','I will help register you after you agree.','A favour does not authorize an unrelated action.')],
[('能打印吗？','Can you print it?','Ask for scope',['可以，哪两页？']),('替我报名。','Register me.','Clarify the activity',['先确认时间，好吗？'])],
'Native check: 求帮助 collocation, 为 beneficiary versus 给 recipient, 有用 evaluation, teacher/school terminology, consent and the original printer scene. No legal representation or automatic registration is implied.')

u='s2-u24'
write(u,'米饭或者面条',['Ask a real choice question with 还是','Read 或者 as an offered option rather than a yes-no question','Separate a word’s pronunciation from its spelling'],[
('或','or','hoặc','conjunction','米饭或面条都可以。','Rice or noodles are both fine.'),('或者','or; alternatively','hoặc; hoặc là','conjunction','你可以先读，或者先听。','You may read first or listen first.'),('不过','however; but','nhưng; tuy vậy','conjunction','我喜欢米饭，不过今天想吃面条。','I like rice, but today I want noodles.'),('不但','not only','không những','conjunction','这个例子不但短，而且有用。','This example is not only short, but also useful.'),('但是','but','nhưng','conjunction','我想参加，但是今天没有时间。','I want to participate, but I have no time today.'),('但','but','nhưng','conjunction','话很短，但意思清楚。','The words are brief, but the meaning is clear.'),('而且','and also; moreover','hơn nữa','conjunction','这里安静，而且离家近。','It is quiet here and also close to home.'),('词语','word; expression','từ ngữ','noun','这个词语的用途先看例子。','First look at an example of how this expression is used.'),('对话','dialogue; conversation','hội thoại','noun','这段对话问想吃什么。','This dialogue asks what someone wants to eat.'),('读音','pronunciation','cách phát âm','noun','字一样，读音不一定一样。','Identical characters do not necessarily have identical pronunciations.'),('音节','syllable','âm tiết','noun','你好有两个音节。','你好 has two syllables.'),('英文','English language or writing','tiếng Anh','noun','英文只用来帮你理解，不是要说的话。','English only helps you understand; it is not the line you are to say.'),('音乐会','concert','buổi hòa nhạc','noun','音乐会以后再吃饭。','We will eat after the concert.'),('例如','for example','ví dụ','verb','例如，你可以说米饭或者面条都可以。','For example, you can say rice or noodles are both fine.'),('例子','example','ví dụ','noun','先听这个例子，再回答。','Listen to this example first, then answer.'),('比如说','for example; say','ví dụ như','verb','比如说，今晚你想吃什么？','For example, what would you like to eat tonight?'),('常见','common; frequently seen','thường gặp','adjective','这是常见的问法。','This is a common way to ask.'),('常用','commonly used','thường dùng','adjective','这是常用的词语。','This is a commonly used expression.'),('听说','to hear that; be told','nghe nói','verb','听说有音乐会，但还没有确认。','I have heard there is a concert, but it has not been confirmed.'),('听讲','to listen to a lecture or explanation','nghe giảng','verb','听讲时先听完，再问读音。','When listening to an explanation, listen to the end before asking about pronunciation.'),('字典','character dictionary; dictionary','từ điển chữ','noun','不懂读音，可以查字典。','If you do not know the pronunciation, you can consult a dictionary.'),('使用','to use','sử dụng','verb','使用这个词语，要看意思和语气。','Use this expression with attention to meaning and tone.')],
[grammar(u,'二29','或 / 或者：陈述中的选择','Offer alternatives in a statement',
'米饭或者面条都可以 offers either option in a statement. In the focused choice question 你想吃米饭还是面条？ use 还是. 或 is often concise or written; 或者 is ordinary in these statements. 或者 may have other uses, but this card teaches the alternative within the sentence, not a prediction.',[
('米饭或者面条都可以。','Rice or noodles are both fine.'),('可以先读或先听。','You may read first or listen first.'),('你想吃米饭还是面条？','Do you want rice or noodles?')],('你想吃米饭或者面条？我问你选哪个。','你想吃米饭还是面条？','Use 还是 to ask the focused choice between the listed options.')),
grammar(u,'二64','选择复句：是 … 还是 …；… 或者 …','Keep the choice scope explicit',
'是先听再读，还是先读再听？ asks between two complete action sequences. 先听再读，或者先读再听，都可以 permits either sequence. Adding 吗 normally makes a yes-no question about a proposal, rather than the focused choice practised here. Answer with the chosen option or explain that both are acceptable.',[
('是先听再读，还是先读再听？','Listen then read, or read then listen?'),('先听再读，或者先读再听，都可以。','Listening then reading or reading then listening are both fine.'),('我是先听再读，不是只听。','I listen then read, not only listen.')],('是先听还是先读吗？请选一个。','是先听还是先读？','For this direct alternative question, omit the yes-no particle.'))],
text(u,'d','After the concert','Find the order of activities and the actual food choice.',[
('听说今晚有音乐会，是真的吗？','I have heard there is a concert tonight; is that true?'),('还要确认。先看消息吧。','It still needs confirmation. Let us check the message first.'),('如果有，音乐会以前还是以后吃饭？','If there is, eat before or after the concert?'),('以后吃。你想吃米饭还是面条？','After. Do you want rice or noodles?'),('米饭或者面条都可以，你选吧。','Rice or noodles are both fine; you choose.'),('我平时喜欢米饭，不过今天想吃面条。','I usually like rice, but today I want noodles.'),('好，面条。先确认音乐会，不是现在就出门。','Okay, noodles. First confirm the concert; do not leave right now.'),('对，听说不是已经确认。','Right; having heard about it is not confirmation.')],
[('mainidea','What is the provisional plan?',['Confirm the concert, then eat noodles afterward if it takes place','Leave immediately for a confirmed show','Eat rice before the show'],0),('detail','What food is eventually chosen?',['Noodles','Rice','Neither was chosen'],0),('inference','Does 听说 establish a confirmed concert?',['No','Yes','Only when it is tonight'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','An expression notebook','Read to use the alternatives in the right sentence.',[
('这段对话里有一个常见的问题：想吃米饭还是面条？','The dialogue contains a common question: do you want rice or noodles?'),('回答米饭或者面条都可以，意思是两种都接受。','Answering either rice or noodles is fine means both choices are acceptable.'),('不是说同时吃两种，也不是说不想吃。','It does not say to eat both simultaneously or refuse food.'),('如果是问先听还是先读，就回答想先做的事。','If asked whether to listen or read first, name the action you want first.'),('学语言时，字典可以查读音，但使用词语还要看例子。','When learning a language, a dictionary can provide pronunciation, but using an expression still needs examples.'),('你好有两个音节，英文意思只是帮助理解。','你好 has two syllables; the English meaning just aids understanding.'),('听说音乐会很好，不过时间还没有确认。','I have heard the concert is good, but its time is not confirmed.'),('先看信息，再选择；例如先听，也可以先读。','Check the information before choosing; for example, listen first, or read first.')],
[('mainidea','What does the notebook explain?',['How to ask and answer alternatives','A confirmed concert timetable','That both foods must be eaten'],0),('detail','What does 都可以 permit?',['Either listed option','Only the first option','No option'],0),('inference','Can a dictionary alone decide every usage?',['No, examples and context also matter','Yes, spelling is enough','Only in English'],0)],[(0,'还是'),(4,'字典')]),
text(u,'media','An undecided friend','Read an original scene where a friend finally chooses.',[
('先读还是先听？','Read first or listen first?'),('都可以。','Either is fine.'),('那先听。米饭还是面条？','Then listen first. Rice or noodles?'),('米饭或面条都可以。','Either rice or noodles is fine.'),('今天由你选一个吧。','Choose one yourself today.'),('好，面条。先听，再吃。','Okay, noodles. Listen first, then eat.')],
[('inference','What changes in the final reply?',['The friend makes a specific choice','Every option is refused','Both foods become compulsory'],0)],drama=True),
dict(tf=[('或者','米饭或者面条都可以。','Rice or noodles are both fine.','Only rice is acceptable.',False,'Either option is allowed.'),('听说','听说有音乐会，但还没有确认。','I heard there is a concert, but it is not confirmed.','The show remains unconfirmed.',True,'还没有确认 states that limitation.')],reply=[('对话','先听还是先读？','Listen first or read first?',['我想先听。','对，三个音节。','是的，我不选。'],0,'Name the preferred action.'),('例子','这个词语怎么使用？','How is this expression used?',['先看一个例子吧。','所以两个音节等于明天。','饭后我在英文。'],0,'Offer an example of use.')],fill=[('字典','不懂读音，可以查字典。','Consult a dictionary if you do not know the pronunciation.'),('不过','我喜欢米饭，不过今天想吃面条。','I like rice, but today I want noodles.')],match=[('音节',[('你好有两个音节。','你好 has two syllables.'),('听说，还没确认。','Heard about it, not yet confirmed.'),('两种都可以。','Either kind is fine.')]),('常用',[('常用的词语。','A commonly used expression.'),('音乐会以后吃饭。','Eat after the concert.'),('先听再读。','Listen, then read.')])]),
[('Allowing either option','两种都可以，你选吧。','Both are fine; you choose.','Does not require doing both.'),('Giving a preference','那我想先听。','Then I would like to listen first.','Name the chosen action instead of a vague yes.')],
[('先听还是先读？','Listen or read first?','Choose an action',['我想先听。']),('米饭还是面条？','Rice or noodles?','Allow either option',['米饭或者面条都可以。'])],
'Native check: 或/或者 and alternative questions, 是…还是… clause scope, 比如说/例如 part-of-speech labels, source 音乐会 pronunciation, terse original scene. No concert schedule or claimed live performance is provided.')

